      "answer": "$x=5\\cos\\left(2t-\\arctan\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$",
      "claim": "3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t) == 5*cos(2t - atan(4/3)) ;; D2(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t)) == -4*(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t)) ;; SUB(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t), 0) == 3 ;; D(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t), 0) == 8"
    },
    {
      "title": "用能量檢查",
      "prompt": "承上題，取 $m=1$、$k=4$，驗證總能量不變。",
      "steps": [
        "$t=0$：動能 $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot1\\cdot8^2=32$，位能 $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot4\\cdot3^2=18$，總和 $50$。",
        "在最遠點 $x=\\pm5$，速度為 $0$：位能 $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot4\\cdot5^2=50$，動能 $0$。",
        "任何時刻 $\\frac{1}{2}x'^2+2x^2$ 都是 $50$。"
      ],
      "answer": "總能量 $50$（焦耳）",
      "claim": "0.5*D(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t))^2 + 0.5*4*(3*cos(2t)+4*sin(2t))^2 == 50"
    }
